<mxCell id="guards" value="&lt;b&gt;Guards on the exits: condition ⇒ the step that remedies it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;G1: a dependency gating planning released ⇒ owner (held)&lt;br&gt;G2: the owner's confirmation ⇒ owner&lt;br&gt;G3: a dependency gating implementation released ⇒ owner (held)&lt;br&gt;G4: HEAD validated, records exempt ⇒ validate, failed or inconclusive: owner&lt;br&gt;G5: in a clone, the bootstrap finished ⇒ wait, failed: owner (held)&lt;br&gt;G6: the fix commit validated, records exempt ⇒ validate, failed or inconclusive: owner&lt;br&gt;G7: a fix committed since the review read ⇒ round-view&lt;br&gt;G8: a fix committed since the review validated ⇒ validate, failed or inconclusive: owner&lt;br&gt;G9: a dependency gating closeout released ⇒ owner (held)&lt;br&gt;G10: the merged HEAD validated, openspec/ and docs/ exempt ⇒ validate, failed: merge, inconclusive: owner&lt;br&gt;G11: a fix outside openspec/ and docs/ validated ⇒ validate, failed or inconclusive: owner&lt;br&gt;G12: a path outside openspec/ and docs/ changed since the first closeout review: HEAD validated ⇒ validate, failed or inconclusive: owner&lt;br&gt;G13: the merged HEAD validated, records exempt ⇒ validate, failed: merge, inconclusive: owner&lt;br&gt;(held): the computation holds a stretch of the workflow on it, before the change is read" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a4f6a;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c9ccd8;rounded=1;arcSize=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="40" width="600" height="262" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
